Use constant-time comparison for remote DevTools secret

CVE-2026-40972: HttpHeaderAccessManager compared the provided remote DevTools
secret against the expected secret using String.equals, which short-circuits on
the first differing byte and leaks timing information (CWE-208, observable
timing discrepancy). This allows a network-adjacent attacker to recover the
secret byte-by-byte via statistical timing analysis. Replace the comparison
with a constant-time MessageDigest.isEqual over the UTF-8 bytes, mirroring
upstream fix 4b0862cc00815a47b22339d7eac7ddc3b6645bd4.

--- a/module/spring-boot-devtools/src/main/java/org/springframework/boot/devtools/remote/server/HttpHeaderAccessManager.java
